        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We advanced manufacturing readiness by accelerating customer qualification activities and reducing custom product development timelines.",
        "start_character": 32364,
        "end_character": 32500
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 28, 2025, we operate in one segment.",
        "start_character": 7285,
        "end_character": 7336
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2025, our Fab2 successfully passed an ISO 9001 audit, and we also completed initial customer audits at both Fab2 and our manufacturing facility in South Korea.",
        "start_character": 32197,
        "end_character": 32363
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Enovix Corporation (the “Company,” “we,” “us,” “our” and “Enovix”) is a global high-performance battery company focused on designing, developing, manufacturing, and commercializing advanced Lithium-ion, or Li-ion, batteries, including proprietary silicon-anode architectures, for smartphones, smart eyewear, defense, industrial and emerging edge-AI applications.",
        "start_character": 34,
        "end_character": 396
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From inception, we have focused on developing a battery architecture that allows the use of 100% active silicon and no graphite in the battery’s anode, which is the negative electrode that stores lithium ions when a battery is charged.",
        "start_character": 1318,
        "end_character": 1553
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Home Grown IP — Unlike many advanced battery startups, which have licensed core technology from government or academic research laboratories, we have developed and own all our intellectual property.",
        "start_character": 28969,
        "end_character": 29167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we further expanded our manufacturing capabilities in South Korea through the acquisition of an adjacent battery cell manufacturing facility and related equipment from Solar Edge.",
        "start_character": 5362,
        "end_character": 5550
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In July 2023, we established a research and design center in Hyderabad, India to further support innovation and provide access to tap a deep pool of specialized engineering and technical talent in fields that are critical to our long-term success.",
        "start_character": 5930,
        "end_character": 6177
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to designing our batteries, we are developing the advanced manufacturing processes needed to produce them at scale and at competitive cost.",
        "start_character": 20420,
        "end_character": 20571
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the second quarter of 2024, we undertook a restructuring plan that included a relocation of Fab1 manufacturing to Malaysia.",
        "start_character": 31676,
        "end_character": 31802
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828318-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828318-26-000006-f943ceaf8d42099f",
        "accession_number": "0001828318-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the smart eyewear market, we also delivered over 1,000 AI-1TM battery packs to our lead customer under a supply agreement and samples to nine additional OEMs and original design manufacturers (“ODM”) as customer programs progressed toward production readiness.",
        "start_character": 3452,
        "end_character": 3715
      }
    ]
